# C09 host assembly — exact change, NOT APPLIED

Issue: https://github.com/liboyang42-cpu/chengyin-remote-ops/issues/5
Repo: github.com/liboyang42-cpu/chengyin-ios
Public base: origin/cursor/c09-async-command-forward-e504 `138380f70b35334c7b62195e4df2038ee7bfd290`
Holder: `App/NativeChannelMessageHostBinding.swift`
Base bytes of that file on the later root: sha256 `b3259c05d5c6d3a867154d87a4cea746bd5d3664568d08873b6eb1e78770a4c1`

The coordinator and journal instances already exist in this file.
`NativeChannelMessageHostBinding.make` creates one `NativeChannelMessageMutationJournal` and passes that same value into `NativeChannelMessageCoordinator` and into `NativeChannelMessageHostFlow`.
`NativeChannelMessageHostFlow.makeTextCoordinator` creates one `NativeChannelTextJournal` and one `NativeChannelTextCoordinator`. A later call returns the stored text coordinator and does not construct another pair.
Those four objects are the arguments of one `NativeChannelMessagePageActions` value stored on the flow.
Send calls `channelActions.send` once. Edit calls `channelActions.edit` once. Recall calls `channelActions.recall` once. Pin calls `channelActions.pin` once. Those page methods are the existing forwarders: send reaches `NativeChannelTextCoordinator.sendNew` once, and edit, recall, and pin each reach `NativeChannelMessageCoordinator.submit` once.
`appear()` calls `channelActions?.appear()` only. Appearance does not send.
A nil page throws the already installed `NativeChannelPageActionFailure.waitingSource`. This hunk adds no type whose only behavior is to wait, and it does not clear a journal.
Do not call `AppSession.makeNativeChannelTextCoordinator`. That method constructs another text journal and another text coordinator.
Do not edit `App/AppSession.swift`, `App/AppCompositionRoot.swift`, or `Questify.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj`.
Do not revert `App/MessagingHistoryView.swift` or `App/ProfileOrdersView.swift`. History async forward is already installed at the later root.
Do not import `ImmutableReceiptProducer.accept` or `recoverOriginal`. Do not add a search chain. Do not add a second journal or a second coordinator.
Swift/XCTest NOT_RUN. Not 100%.

## Patch (NOT APPLIED)

